OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FYorkshire's A&E struggles with too
OL,7,     Fmany patients and not enough room
OL,8,     Ffor them as they work to treat
OL,9,     Finternal chest wounds, a collapsed
OL,10,     Flung and a back injury.
OL,11,G2100 999: Critical Condition
OL,12,     FMotorcyclist Danny is rushed into
OL,13,     Fthe emergency department following
OL,14,     Fa high-speed road traffic accident
OL,15,     Fin north Wales.
OL,16,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,17,     FAn aggressive patient is
OL,18,     Frestrained in Newham as Dr Nick
OL,19,     Forders ketamine sedation for a
OL,20,     Fhead injury. In Belfast, teenager
OL,21,     FJack suffers spinal shock after a
OL,22,     Fhorrific motorcycle crash.
