OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FCan Dr Emma remove some cysts from
OL,7,     Fpatient Georgia's leg without them
OL,8,     Fexploding? Dr Adil Sheraz tackles
OL,9,     Flipomas and there's an
OL,10,     Feye-watering mole for Dr Dev Shah.
OL,11,G0000 The Surgeon
OL,12,     FBehind the surgeon's mask - from
OL,13,     Fthe pressurised operating theatre
OL,14,     Fto life at home - as consultant
OL,15,     Fheart surgeon Inder Birdi faces
OL,16,     Fone of the most challenging cases
OL,17,     Fof his career.
