OL,10,     Fbefore kidnapping her - with fatal
OL,11,     Fconsequences.
OL,12,G0200 Acts of Murder
OL,13,     FWhen Texas firefighter Robert
OL,14,     FPoynter was fatally shot in the
OL,15,     Fhead, his wife Chacey appeared
OL,16,     Fdistraught - but she was
OL,17,     Fconcealing a dark secret. Three
OL,18,     Fsuper sleuths explore her
OL,19,     Fbehaviour. (Ep4)
